<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Foster's shares top turnover lists.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Foster's shares top turnover lists.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Foster's Brewing Group Ltd topped turnover lists in early trade on Thursday with 6.96 million shares traded.</p>
<p>Over six million of these were put through the market prior to the opening and brokers said the trades were dividend and options related.</p>
<p>The major brewer goes ex-dividend five cents today.</p>
<p>By 10.35 a.m. (2335 GMT), Fosters shares were six cents lower at A$2.67.</p>
<p>Foster's is about 37 percent owned by the Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd. -- Walter Watson 61-2 9373 1810</p>
</text>
